# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间来回切换时
# 每个文件都显示成「整个文件被改写」，diff 完全没法看。
# 仓库内部统一存 LF，检出时按平台自动处理。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确标记为二进制，禁止任何换行符转换和 diff 文本化
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.onnx binary
*.cache binary
*.db binary

# 压缩包
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
